# Frontend Patterns

## Stack

React + TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, @tanstack/react-query, react-router-dom.

## API Layer

- `api/client.ts` — typed `request<T>()` wrapper around fetch. All endpoints under `/api/v1`.
- `hooks/useApi.ts` — react-query hooks wrapping every API call. Mutations invalidate relevant query keys.
- `types/index.ts` — must match backend response shapes exactly. Update when backend changes.

## Pages

| Page | Purpose | Key hooks |
|---|---|---|
| Dashboard | Overview, quick links | `useOrderIntents("pending")` |
| Scanner | Full scan (broker + LLM) → generates intents | `useTriggerScan` |
| Conviction | EMA trend analysis only (informational) | `useConvictionScan`, `useTriggerConvictionScan` |
| Intents | Approve/reject trade recommendations | `useOrderIntents`, `useApproveIntent`, `useRejectIntent` |
| Orders | Open orders + executed trades | `useOpenOrders`, `useOrderIntents("executed")` |
| Monitor | Track positions, real-time P&L + alerts | `useTrackedPositions`, `useTrackPosition` |
| Settings | Editable config (watchlist, capital, risk) | `useSystemConfig`, `useUpdateConfig` |

## UI Conventions

- Risk-failed items: red border (`border-red-500/30 bg-red-950/10`) + "RISK FAILED" badge
- Conviction colors: high=emerald, medium=amber, low=red, none=gray
- Alert severity: critical=red, warning=amber, info=gray
- Risk summary reasons: `FAIL:` prefix=red, `WARN:`=amber, plain=gray
- Empty states must show explanatory messages, not blank space
- `StatusBadge` for labels, `PLValue` for P&L numbers, `Card` for sections

## Monitor Page

Tracked positions are **in-memory only** on the backend — lost on restart. The position card shows live data from Tradier (underlying price, option bid/ask, greeks, P&L). When Tradier data is unavailable (market closed), a fallback status is returned with an info alert.

Option symbol matching: first tries exact match, then falls back to strike + option type match (handles format mismatches between user input and Tradier OCC format).
